      "reasoning": "Article 4A(2)(c) extends combatant status to members of militias or volunteer corps forming part of a party's armed forces, provided they meet the conditions of being under responsible command, having a fixed organization, carrying arms openly, and conducting operations in accordance with the laws and customs of war. The Tarsk Highland Volunteers are acknowledged by the Tarsk defence ministry, receive weapons, operate under a commander, enforce a code of conduct, and thus satisfy these conditions. Consequently, the captured individual qualifies as a combatant.",
